I've modified some code of the RemoteREngine to deal with new interfaces 
from the org.rosuda.REngine package.

Mainly, we don't need the RMainLoopCallbacks anymore (tight to Rengine 
with a lower case e) and the methods have been replaced by several 
interfaces) :

REngineCallbacks
REngineInputInterface
REngineConsoleHistoryInterface
REngineUIInterface
REngineOutputInterface

This should not change how the package works. Not that the rosuda jars 
(REngine.jar and JRIEngine.jar are still my custom builds since the 
serialzation patch we need has not yet been applied)

Romain

